OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chiefs at odds over force's
OL,4,Afuture
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut while the force's Chief Constable
OL,7,FVictoria Fuller believes the events
OL,8,Fshowed a single North-East police force
OL,9,F"may make sense", police and crime
OL,10,Fcommissioner (PCC) Matt Storey, who
OL,11,Fappointed her to the role, said he did
OL,12,Fnot believe "bigger was better", nor
OL,13,Fwere mergers required.
OL,15,FThe discussion comes amid a government
OL,16,Freview into policing, which is expected
OL,17,Fto recommend fewer, but larger sized
OL,18,Fforces in England and Wales.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
